      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但真机伶却坚定地否定\n记者说她“参赛只是玩票性质”的质疑。\n并真诚地说出了自己对比赛的想法──",
      "source_fingerprint": "d09258149c41918278b7bb8f76aeac875d497fffb980841af8788e052a9c9891",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
