      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终，真机伶的话语打动了记者，\n展露了高明的手段让记者也称赞她可爱。\n而这份采访内容发布之后……",
      "source_fingerprint": "648355ab933d964bb24c93b41b39df2c9e9df588cef01eb68fb8dc05b4c2c2bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1038/storytimeline_501038401.json",
      "json_path": [
