      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不仅如此，今后也要在“Umasta”以外的\n“Umatok”、“Umatter”等，\n各大社交平台积极更新。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61aa1b33f9d21e1fd7151dc69dcbe0b63cce1d26e2c190a288d6fc341d182f54",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
