    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9e41025f8d9eb0045f9a796",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然宣传活动感觉会在比赛前累积疲劳……\n但真机伶不顾训练员的担心，\n继续奋力在网络上宣扬自己的可爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "297996cbaab7bc770d544af5eb56e5e35ad5e0a406c6f13e73a54327e810eceb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
