      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特摄系Umatok网红微光飞驹。\n料理系Umasta网红菱曙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf7828a3e0d4a6a03c3b04d37cd10213f288583b92fad4954c4f93bad5c178e6",
